# NOTE: public/ is deliberately NOT ignored. It carries serve.json, which sets
# the security response headers on the running container — and losing those
# would be silent: the site still works, nothing fails, the headers are just
# gone. See the comment in frontend/Dockerfile.
#
# (The build context is ./frontend, so backend/, scripts/, tests/ and infra/
# are already outside it and need no entry here.)
